WEBVTT

00:10:59.988 --> 00:11:03.826
in order to protect
their cultural preservation

00:11:03.867 --> 00:11:05.703
and the wild rice.

00:11:05.744 --> 00:11:09.164
And in New Jersey,
Ironbound Community Corporation,

00:11:09.206 --> 00:11:13.460
along with the New Jersey
Environmental Justice Alliance,

00:11:13.502 --> 00:11:16.213
has helped push legislation

00:11:16.213 --> 00:11:20.884
that has enabled the state
to deny permits,

00:11:20.884 --> 00:11:25.180
any new permits, to already
overburdened, overpolluted neighborhoods.

00:11:25.222 --> 00:11:27.725
And it's set a standard
for other states to use,

00:11:27.725 --> 00:11:32.771
which has become a historic environmental
justice legislation for the country.